TI  - X-FedAgriTwin: Privacy-preserving crop recommendation via Digital Twins and explainable federated learning
PY  - 2026
T2  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 196
C7  - 108173
DO  - 10.1016/j.infsof.2026.108173
