AB  - The rapid advancements in Artificial Intelligence (AI) have revolutionized cybersecurity operations, because they now enable predictive hazard detection and automatic incident responses as well as adaptive security measures. The combination of artificial intelligence-based security solutions uses machine learning algorithms with deep learning technology alongside predictive analytics for analyzing amount of data to detect anomalies while fighting cyber threats instantly. AI delivers many blessings in cybersecurity but brings multiple demanding situations that include targeted attacks on systems underlying biases and important concerns regarding privacy and transparency. AI deployment needs explainable AI (XAI) and robust security frameworks and ethical guidelines to maintain accountability because cybercriminals are more often than not leveraging AI for advanced attacks. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
