TI  - Beyond the Clinic: Artificial Intelligence Transforming STI Self-Assessment, Early Detection, and Personalized Decision Support
PY  - 2026
T2  - Applied Sciences (Switzerland)
VL  - 16
IS  - 16
C7  - 7883
