TI  - AI-Enabled Competency-Based Learning: An Integrated Framework for Assessment, Adaptation, and Organizational Decision Support
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings - 2026 International Conference on Current Research in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science, ICCRAIDS 2026
DO  - 10.1109/ICCRAIDS67816.2026.11519706
