AD  - School of Bioengineering and Biosciences, Lovely Professional University, Phagwara, India
AD  - School of Chemical Engineering and Physical Science, Lovely Professional University, Phagwara, India
AB  - Generative and explainable AI is rapidly transforming the cybersecurity and information security ecosystems through intelligent automation, adaptive threat detection, and decision support at unparalleled scale. While generative AI augments security operations by automating incident response, adversarial simulation, and threat intelligence synthesis, it simultaneously scales up cyber risks in deepfakes, polymorphic malware, and large- scale disinformation. This chapter critically discusses the dual- use nature of generative AI from a technical, legal, privacy, ethical, and governance perspective. Particular emphasis has been given to the pivotal role played by explainable AI in bringing accountability, legal defensibility, and human oversight back into automated security infrastructures. The chapter further reviews the global regulatory landscape, limitations in existing safeguards, and future research directions toward trustworthy, human- centered AI- enabled cybersecurity systems. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing.
