TI  - A Secure and Explainable Federated Edge-AI Framework for Climate-Smart Smallholder Farming
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings of 9th International Conference on Trends in Electronics and Informatics, ICOEI 2026
SP  - 914
EP  - 919
