TI  - Interpreting Blockchain-Coordinated Federated Models for Cervical Cancer Risk Prediction using SHAP and LIME
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of International Conference on Sustainable Communication Networks and Application, ICSCN 2025
SP  - 818
EP  - 822
DO  - 10.1109/ICSCN67106.2025.11308399
