inable Food Consumption; comprehensive Representation of Variation Interpretation Data via Conceptual Modeling; CoffeeWKG: A Weather Knowledge Graph for Coffee Regions in Colombia; enhancing Precision Medicine: An Automatic Pipeline Approach for Exploring Genetic Variant-Disease Literature.
